This document differs from p_bcd1 (which models two weekday walks and the leash leaving twice) by asserting a single morning walk on weekdays (07:00–08:00) and a single late-morning walk on weekends (10:00–11:00), with the leash out only during those windows. It also pins the resting spots for the bowl, food bag, and toy, which p_bcd1 leaves to the statistical model. The dog bowl is *always* in the kitchen when in the house — it is not carried around. The food bag stays in the pantry except during the brief moment of filling the bowl.

